        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people think that hosting an international sports event is good for the country, while some people think it is bad. Discuss both views and give your opinion.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HGAqdOlYlo5tnYxpUWolpy11gJd\"><em><strong>Some people think that hosting an international sports event is good for the country, while some people think it is bad. Discuss both views and give your opinion.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">IELTS Writing Task 2 - Hosting Sports Events&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QGthd7gvDo6sWdxpo3XlUXwsgPb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Hosting Sports Events&nbsp;cho 2 quan điểm:</strong> Một số người cho rằng việc đăng cai tổ chức sự kiện thể thao quốc tế c&oacute; lợi cho đất nước<em> (Quan điểm 1)</em>, trong khi một số người kh&aacute;c cho rằng điều đ&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng tốt<em> </em><em>(Quan điểm 2)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdeCdrVVEoTQc5xSS7glBLJggof\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến của bạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hr2nd2oHDowDL4xw4A5lqgAIgic\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Hosting Sports Events&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GJgQdtqBToTEl0xxQo9lxMZDg8b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YtZPdCrpvokPKdxjoKfleQSpgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KvhQdPUSFomLJYxGUutlGb17g5b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PvQHdNLruoAys4xF3h2lBMasgzf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>benefit/ harm the host nations <em>(c&oacute; lợi/ g&acirc;y hại cho nước chủ nh&agrave;)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm thứ 2, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'việc đăng cai tổ chức sự kiện thể quốc tế mang lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch hơn l&agrave; t&aacute;c hại cho nước chủ nh&agrave;'. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q4XZdGZOzo6YWpxUG8hlYdrhgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đ&oacute;ng vai ng&ocirc;i thứ 3: b&agrave;n về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGbvdgzmQoS0hgxxihWlGfcRgdg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh: xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, c&aacute;c quốc gia <em>đảm nhận tr&aacute;ch nhiệm (take on the responsibility of)</em> tổ chức c&aacute;c giải đấu thể thao lớn phải đối mặt với những kh&oacute; khăn nhất định.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YqMPdte9voodbAxxJQYlrWnqggc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OeEjdM5DqoxCagxQI4GlVBYWgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Vấn đề đ&aacute;ng kể nhất l&agrave; <em>g&aacute;nh nặng t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh qu&aacute; lớn (excessive financial burden)</em> đi k&egrave;m với việc tổ chức c&aacute;c sự kiện n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qd03dknlDoiuIcx9qfklWgkkgmd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Việc đăng cai đ&ograve;i hỏi đầu tư lớn v&agrave;o c&aacute;c s&acirc;n vận động v&agrave; cơ sở vật chất mới, thường dẫn đến <em>nợ d&agrave;i hạn k&eacute;o d&agrave;i (long-term debt) </em>nhiều năm sau khi sự kiện kết th&uacute;c. Số tiền n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể <em>được ph&acirc;n bổ tốt hơn cho (better allocated to)</em> c&aacute;c dịch vụ thiết yếu như gi&aacute;o dục hoặc y tế.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OQsVdxOoXonsnwxgGxgluDPhgse\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tb5IdriWWoB81MxBogQlLuhrgnL\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>việc di dời cư d&acirc;n địa phương (displacement of local residents)</em> tạo ra một vấn đề nghi&ecirc;m trọng kh&aacute;c</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFp5dAIZyoY0xmxukA2lBCATgof\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Việc x&acirc;y dựng mới thường đ&ograve;i hỏi phải giải tỏa c&aacute;c khu d&acirc;n cư, buộc c&aacute;c gia đ&igrave;nh phải <em>di dời với mức đền b&ugrave; kh&ocirc;ng thỏa đ&aacute;ng (relocate with inadequate compensation)</em>. T&igrave;nh huống n&agrave;y thường g&acirc;y ra <em>căng thẳng x&atilde; hội (social tensions)</em> v&agrave; c&aacute;c vấn đề về nh&agrave; ở c&oacute; thể <em>k&eacute;o d&agrave;i nhiều năm (persist for years).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, những bất lợi n&agrave;y <em>bị lu mờ bởi (overshadowed by)</em> những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; việc đăng cai c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao quốc tế mang lại</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EnJAdeUfWoNnIUxvQsJlluC8gSc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fm0qdQUvMorX2xxTgYfly6McgVc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Đầu ti&ecirc;n, c&aacute;c sự kiện th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể <em>n&acirc;ng cao danh tiếng</em> <em>của một quốc gia (enhance a country's reputation)</em> tr&ecirc;n trường quốc tế</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FtYYdVWcxo5y8Vx1i6Zl5TJCgWR\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Khi một quốc gia tổ chức hiệu quả một cuộc thi lớn, n&oacute; thể hiện khả năng tổ chức của m&igrave;nh, như đ&atilde; thấy khi H&agrave;n Quốc c<em>ải thiện vị thế to&agrave;n cầu (improve its global standing)</em> sau khi đăng cai World Cup 2002. H&igrave;nh ảnh được cải thiện n&agrave;y thường dẫn đến <em>tăng đầu tư nước ngo&agrave;i (increased foreign investment)</em> v&agrave;<em> mối quan hệ ngoại giao mạnh mẽ hơn (stronger diplomatic relationships)</em> với c&aacute;c quốc gia kh&aacute;c</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CM1TdmLiXol94txVnGLlHbmjgDe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CkztdliZ9oG1n9xF5rcl7Aomg4d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Hơn nữa, những sự kiện n&agrave;y <em>tạo ra doanh thu đ&aacute;ng kể (generate substantial revenue)</em> từ du lịch</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N4oMdoae5o2CPNxn1i7lTQp7gjQ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> C&aacute;c sự kiện n&agrave;y thu h&uacute;t h&agrave;ng ngh&igrave;n du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế chi ti&ecirc;u cho chỗ ở, thực phẩm v&agrave; đồ lưu niệm. C&aacute;c doanh nghiệp địa phương <em>trải qua sự b&ugrave;ng nổ về (experience a boom in)</em> doanh số b&aacute;n h&agrave;ng trong v&agrave; sau c&aacute;c sự kiện, điều n&agrave;y tạo ra việc l&agrave;m v&agrave; <em>k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch nền kinh tế (stimulate the economy)</em> tr&ecirc;n nhiều lĩnh vực.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L17VdiXZUoY36CxtFgalzGPngfg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaIxdHMttobfwVxrFPMlgH7KgJh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>financial strain and residential displacement <em>(căng thẳng t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; di dời d&acirc;n cư)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjvDdPYH8oOrmFx1BhJldRSMghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">enhanced global reputation and economic growth <em>(n&acirc;ng cao danh tiếng to&agrave;n cầu v&agrave; tăng trưởng kinh tế)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 881,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AhVJd5VVboCBVnxH1rrlNVxGgEc\">Opinions are divided on whether hosting international sporting events such as the Olympics or World Cup benefits or harms the host nations. Although organizing such events may pose challenges to the host country, I believe the advantages significantly outweigh these drawbacks.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14857,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 882,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNNcdanx1opie6xBO1dl0plMghb\"><strong>Admittedly, countries that take on the responsibility of hosting major sporting competitions face certain difficulties.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The most significant issue is the excessive financial burden that comes with organizing these events. Hosting requires huge investments in new stadiums and facilities, which often leads to long-term debt for many years after the event ends. This money could potentially be better allocated to essential services like education or healthcare.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, the displacement of local residents creates another serious problem. New construction frequently requires clearing residential areas, forcing families to relocate with inadequate compensation. This situation often gives rise to social tensions and housing problems that can persist for years.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14857,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 883,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TQpzdL23Ro1xg8xKnhhl7uHlgnf\"><strong>However, these disadvantages are overshadowed by the substantial benefits that hosting international sporting events brings.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Firstly, successful events significantly enhance a country's reputation on the global stage. When a nation effectively organizes a major competition, it showcases its organizational abilities, as seen when South Korea improved its global standing after hosting the 2002 World Cup. This improved image often translates into increased foreign investment and stronger diplomatic relationships with other countries.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, these events generate substantial revenue from tourism. They attract thousands of international visitors who spend money on accommodations, food, and souvenirs. Local businesses experience a boom in sales during and after the events, which creates jobs and stimulates the economy across multiple sectors.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14857,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 884,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VKEOddbm9oefNIx5dJ0lniV4ghf\">In conclusion, while hosting international sporting events does present certain challenges like financial strain and residential displacement, I believe the benefits of enhanced global reputation and economic growth make it a worthwhile endeavor for countries.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14857,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
